  "readme": "## README.md\n# Field boundaries for Thuringia (TH), Germany\n\nProvides ca. 100.000 official field boundaries from the federal state of Thuringia (TH) in Germany.\nIt has been converted to a fiboa GeoParquet file from a file that was provided by the state.\n\n- **Source Data Provider:** [Th\u00fcringer Landesamt f\u00fcr Landwirtschaft und L\u00e4ndlichen Raum](https://geomis.geoportal-th.de/geonetwork/srv/ger/catalog.search#/metadata/D872F2D6-60BC-11D6-B67D-00E0290F5BA0)\n- **Converted by:** [Matthias Mohr](https://mohr.ws)\n- **License:** [Germany - attribution - Version 2.0](https://www.govdata.de/dl-de/by-2-0)\n\n---\n\n- **[Download the data as fiboa GeoParquet](https://data.source.coop/fiboa/de-th/de-th.parquet)**\n- [STAC Browser](https://radiantearth.github.io/stac-browser/#/external/data.source.coop/fiboa/de-th/stac/collection.json)\n- [STAC Collection](https://data.source.coop/fiboa/de-th/stac/collection.json)\n- [PMTiles](https://data.source.coop/fiboa/de-th/de-th.pmtiles)\n\n## Lineage\n\n- Data downloaded on 2024-08-13 from https://www.geoproxy.geoportal-th.de/download-service/opendata/agrar/DGK_Thue.zip.\n- Converted to GeoParquet using [fiboa-cli](https://github.com/fiboa/cli), version 0.6.0.\n",
